to anger a lot of people, including even some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:27.520
people in my friends and family. The entire thing&nbsp;
stinks to high heaven. That's my honest view. So&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:32.560
