we're going to kind of dig into it in more detail.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:41.680
BBC News reports Cristina Kirchner gunned James&nbsp;
during bid to kill Argentina vice president.&nbsp;&nbsp;

